AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000014> "A fossil combustion fuel is a combustion fuel with the origin fossil.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000014> "fossil combustion fuel"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000014> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000099> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000530> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030002>)))
