AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000031> "A power plant is an energy transformation unit consisting of power generating units and a grid component that feeds electric energy into an electric grid.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000031> "power plant"@en)
