AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000097> "A combustible energy carrier is an energy carrier that releases energy from a material entity in form of heat or work, by chemical reaction with other substances.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000097> "combustible energy carrier disposition"@en)
