AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000099> "A combustion fuel is a fuel that realises its fuel role in processes that release energy in the form of heat or work by chemical reaction with other substances.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000099> "combustion fuel"@en)
