SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000115> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000091> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000097>))
