AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000158> "An energy transformation sector is a sector that covers energy production, energy transformation from primary to secondary energy and transport of energy to the demand sector.")
