# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010082> (trade)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010082> "A trade is a process in which one good or service is exchanged for another good or service or money.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010082> "trade"@en)
