# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010114> (waste thermal energy)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010114> "Waste thermal energy is thermal energy that is the physical output of an energy transformation process and that is released into the environment unused."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010114> "waste thermal energy"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010114> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000207>)

