AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010117> "The role of an independent continuant or energy over which ownership rights can be established, whose ownership can be passed from one party to another by engaging in transactions, and that is not money.")
