# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010126> (Annual Emission Allocation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010126> "An Annual Emission Allocation (AEA) is an emission certificate used in the Effort Sharing Decision (ESD) and the Effort Sharing Regulation (ESR). It permits the emission of a CO2 equivalent quantity of 1 tonne.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010126> "Annual Emission Allocation"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010126> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020063>)

