AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010458> "A regulatory instrument is a policy instrument that stipulates rules made by a government (=institution) to control the way something is done."@en)
