AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010489> "A unit of measurement is a generically dependent continuant that represents a standardised quantity value of a quantifiable entity"@en)
