AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020039> "energy carrier"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020039> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000091> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000151>)))
