AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020064> "An EU Allowance (EUA) is an emission certificate used in the European Union Emissions Trading System (EU ETS). It permits the emission of a CO2 equivalent quantity of 1 tonne.")
