AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020143> "An area value is a quantity value indicating the size of a two-dimensional spatial region.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020143> "area value"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020143> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350>)
