SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020143> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020056> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00340068>))
