AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020148> "A conventional energy carrier disposition is an energy carrier disposition of a material entity that contains non-renewable energy.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020148> "conventional energy carrier disposition"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020148> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000151>)

