AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020154> "Emission certificate price is a monetary price of an emission certificate that allows the emission of a certain emission value.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020154> "emission certificate price"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020154> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010268>)
