# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166> (methodology)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166> "A methodology is a plan specification that describes processes that are part of a study.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166> "methodology"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000104>)
