# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020202> (export)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020202> "Export is the process of selling goods or services abroad and their delivery to a foreign market.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020202> "export"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020202> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
