AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020204> "An electrical energy amount value is an energy amount value that measures a quantity of electrical energy.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020204> "electrical energy amount value"@en)
