# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020206> (electricity export value)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020206> "An electricity export value is an electrical energy amount value that measures the export of electrical energy."@en)
