AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020208> "Electricity export is the export of electrical energy.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020208> "electricity export"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020208> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020202>)
