AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020264> "A material transformation is a transformation in which one or more input material entities are, at least partially, physically changed and result in output material entites."@en)
