# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020352> (model)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020352> "A model is a continuant to represent a system and its behaviours in a simplified or idealised way.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020352> "model"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020352> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000002> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020353>)))
