SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020352> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140164> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002577>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020353> (model role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020353> "A model role is a a role of a continuant for representing a system and its behaviours in a simplified or idealised way.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020353> "model role"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020353> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>)
