# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020354> (mathematical model)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020354> "A mathematical model is a information content artifact that represents a system and its behaviours mathematically.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020354> "mathematical model"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020354> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020354> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020353>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020427> (monetary price)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020427> "A monetary price is a quality of a product that indicates the value in terms of the amount of money requested, expected, required or given in exchange for something else.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020427> "monetary price")
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020427> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020427> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000080> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010501>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020427> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140002> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040003>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030001> (biogenic)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030001> "Biogenic is an origin of portions of matter made by or produced from life forms.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030001> "biogenic"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030001> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000316>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030001> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000331>))
DisjointClasses(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030001> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030002>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030002> (fossil)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030002> "Fossil is a geogenic origin of portions of matter created from organic material by geological processes lasting thousands or millions of years.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030002> "fossil"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030002> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030003>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030002> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000331>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030003> (geogenic)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030003> "Geogenic is an origin of portions of matter or energies that are the result of geological processes.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030003> "geogenic"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030003> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000316>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030003> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> ObjectUnionOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000150> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000331>)))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030019> (process attribute)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030019> "A process attribute is a dependent occurrent that existentially depends on a process.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030019> "process attribute"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030019> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000003>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030022> (organisation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030022> "An organisation is an immaterial entity that has the organisation role and there exists some sort of legal framework that recognises the entity and its continued existence.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030022> "organisation"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030022> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000141>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030022> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000315>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030024> (energy system)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030024> "An energy system is a supply system of spatially extended linked energy sources and sinks.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030024> "energy system"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030024> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030025>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030025> (supply system)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030025> "A supply system is a system that connects producers and consumers.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030025> "supply system"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030025> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002577>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030029> (exogenous data)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030029> "Exogenous data is a data item whose quantity value is determined outside of a model and is imposed on a model.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030029> "exogenous data"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030029> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020189> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000275>)))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030029> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030029> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000136> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030029> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400022>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030030> (endogenous data)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030030> "Endogenous data is a data item whose quantity value is determined by a model.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030030> "endogenous data"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030030> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020190> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000275>)))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030030> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027>)
