# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030031> (start time)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030031> "A start time is a zero-dimensional temporal region that indicates the beginning of a one-dimensional temporal region.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030031> "start time"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030031> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000148>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030032> (ending time)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030032> "An ending time is a zero-dimensional temporal region that indicates the end of a one-dimensional temporal region.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030032> "ending time"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030032> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000148>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030033> (time step)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030033> "A time step is a one-dimensional temporal region that has a start time and an ending time and thus a finite duration.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030033> "time step"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030033> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000038>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030033> ObjectUnionOf(ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030031>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030032>)) ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030035>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140043>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140044>))))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030034> (time series)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030034> "A time series is a data set that references to a set of time steps or zero-dimensional temporal regions.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030034> "time series"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030034> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000100>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030034> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030031>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030034> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030032>))
