# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030035> (time span)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030035> "A time span is a quantity value indicating the duration of a one-dimensional temporal region, measured in a time unit.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030035> "time span"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030035> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030035> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020056> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000038>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030035> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000003>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040002> (market exchange role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040002> "A role of an organisation, association, or group of persons, whether incorporated or unincorporated, which constitutes, maintains, or provides a facility for bringing together purchasers and sellers of financial instruments, commodities, or other products, services, or goods, and includes the market place and facilities maintained by the exchange")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040002> "market exchange role"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040002> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040003> (monetary value)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040003> "A monetary value is a quantity value that states the amount of money specified in monetary units.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040003> "monetary value"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040003> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040003> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020056> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010116>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040003> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040010> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040004>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040004> (currency)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040004> "A unit which is a measure of the medium of an exchange value, defined by reference to the geographical location of the monetary authorities responsible for it.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040004> "currency"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040004> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010489>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040011> (commodity role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040011> "A commodity role is a good role that inheres in something that is used in commerce and is exchangeable with other commodities of the same type.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040011> "commodity role"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040011> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010117>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050000> (manufacturing process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050000> "A manufacturing process is a process that produces artificial objects or object aggregates that are economic goods. It involves several subprocesses, which are energy transformations and material transformations amongst others."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050000> "manufacturing process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050000> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020003>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020264>)))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050000> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002234> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000061>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010117>))))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050001> (fuel-powered electricity generation process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050001> "A fuel-powered electricity generation process is an electricity generation process that converts chemical energy from a combustion fuel to electrical energy. It causes some emission.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050001> "fuel-powered electricity generation process"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050001> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240014> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000532> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000099>)))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050001> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stap-m/midlevel-energy-ontology/main/ontology/src/midlevel-energy.owl/MENO_01013> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0019002> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000007>))) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stap-m/midlevel-energy-ontology/main/ontology/src/midlevel-energy.owl/MENO_01014> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0019001> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000139>)))))
