# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140116> (fluid)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140116> "A fluid is a material entity which is a liquid, gas or plasma.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140116> "fluid"@en)
