# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140124> (service)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140124> "A service is a process that is an intangible activity performed by some agent for the benefit of another agent.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140124> "service"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140124> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
