# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140149> (transformative measure)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140149> "A transformative measure is a process that is an activity that has a direct impact on a specific variable in question.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140149> "transformative measure"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140149> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140150> (policy)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140150> "A policy is a plan specification that is a deliberate system of principles, rules and guidelines, adopted by an organisation to guide decision making with respect to particular situations and implemented to achieve stated goals.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140150> "policy"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140150> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000104>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140150> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020093>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140150> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140151>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140150> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030022>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140151> (policy instrument)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140151> "A policy instrument is an action specification of an organisation (e.g. a government) that promotes transformative measures."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140151> "policy instrument"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140151> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000007>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140151> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000136> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030022>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140151> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010119> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140149>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140159> (hydrocarbon)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140159> "Hydrocarbon is a portion of matter which is member of class of organic chemical compounds composed only of the elements carbon (C) and hydrogen (H).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140159> "hydrocarbon"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140159> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000331>)
