# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240012> (gross electricity generation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240012> "Gross electricity generation is a process attribute that refers to the total amount of electrical energy produced in an electricity generation process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240012> "gross electricity generation"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240012> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030019>)
