# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240013> (net electricity generation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240013> "Net electricity generation is a process attribute that equals to gross electricity generation minus the consumption of power stations' auxiliary services."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240013> "net electricity generation"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240013> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00030019>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240013> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140002> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00050019>))

