# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410060> (electricity grid voltage level)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410060> "An electricity grid voltage level is a quantity value reflecting the normative voltage value that an electricity grid is operating on."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410060> "electricity grid voltage level"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410060> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410060> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000217>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410060> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001920> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410068>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410067> (grid component role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410067> "A grid component role is a role of an energy transformation unit that is a discrete part of a supply grid serving a specific purpose."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410067> "grid component role"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410067> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410068> (rated voltage)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410068> "Rated voltage is a Performance Specification that prescribes the intended operating voltage of some electrical artifact."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410068> "rated voltage"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410068> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000127>)

