AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010038> "The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) energy is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
All GHG emissions arising from combustion and fugitive releases of fuels. Emissions from the non-energy uses of fuels are generally not included here, but reported under Industrial Processes and Product Use.")
