# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010124> (Effort Sharing Decision)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010124> "The Effort Sharing Decision (ESD) is the European effort sharing for the years 2013-2020. It covers the European Union, Norway, Iceland and Liechtenstein and the following greenhouse gases: carbon dioxide, methane, nitrous oxide, hydrofluorocarbons, perfluorocarbons and sulphur hexafluoride. Emission quantities under the ESD are calculated using global warming potentials from the Fourth IPCC Assessment Report.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010124> "Effort Sharing Decision"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010123> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010124>)
