# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010168> (CRF sector (IPCC 2006): iron and steel production)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010168> "The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'iron and steel production' is an industry sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Carbon dioxide is the predominant gas emitted from the production of iron and steel. The sources of the carbon dioxide emissions include that from carbon-containing reducing agents such as coke and pulverized coal, and, from minerals such as limestone and dolomite added.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010168> "CRF sector (IPCC 2006): iron and steel production"@en)
