AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010342> "The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'glass production' is an industry sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Process-related emissions from the production of various types of glass (ISIC: D2610).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010342> "CRF sector (IPCC 2006): glass production"@en)
