AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010352> "The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'fluorochemical production' is an industry sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:")
