# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010353> (CRF sector (IPCC 2006): chemical industry - other)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010353> "The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'chemical industry - other' is an industry sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
For example, gases with global warming potential listed in IPCC assessment reports that do not fall within any categories above could be reported here, if they are estimated.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010353> "CRF sector (IPCC 2006): chemical industry - other"@en)
