ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140044> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140046>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140047> (end alignment)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140047> "An end alignment is a time stamp alignment indicating that the time stamp marks the end of the time step.")
