# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140069> (instantaneous)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140069> "value measured at or modelled for exactly one 0-dim temporal region, referenced by a time stamp, e.g. to represent a time step in a time series")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140069> "instantaneous"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140068> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140069>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140070> (integral)

