AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140070> "integral"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140068> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140070>)

