ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140167> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140169>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360042> (BSI-KritisV energy sector)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360042> "The BSI-KritisV energy sector is an energy transformation sector defined by the BSI-KritisV sector division (§ 2 BSI-KritisV)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360042> "BSI-KritisV energy sector"@en)
