# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360043> (BSI-KritisV transport sector)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360043> "The BSI-KritisV transport sector is a transport sector defined by the BSI-KritisV sector division (§ 8 BSI-KritisV)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360043> "BSI-KritisV transport sector"@en)
