# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360044> (BSI-KritisV sector division)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360044> "The BSI-KritisV sector division is a sector division by the German regulation BSI-Kritisverordnung (BSI-KritisV) defining eight sectors that contain critical infrastructures."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360044> "BSI-KritisV sector division"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000368> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360044>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400014> (ambiguous uncertainty)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400014> "Ambiguous uncertainty is a nature of model uncertainty that stems from multiple frames of reference about a phenomenon existing similtaneously.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400014> "ambiguous uncertainty"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400013> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400014>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400015> (epistemological uncertainty)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400015> "Epistemological uncertainty is a nature of model uncertainty that stems from a lack of knowledge about a certain phenomenon.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400015> "epistemological uncertainty"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400013> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400015>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400016> (ontological uncertainty)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400016> "Ontological uncertainty is a nature of model uncertainty that stems from inherent variability of a phenomenon.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400016> "ontological uncertainty"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400013> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400016>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400018> (shallow uncertainty)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400018> "Shallow uncertainty is a level of model uncertainty at which one can enumerate multiple alternatives and provide probabilites(subjective or objective) for them.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400018> "shallow uncertainty"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400017> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400018>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019> (medium uncertainty)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019> "Medium uncertainty is a level of model uncertainty at which one can enumerate multiple alternatives and rank them in order of perceived likelihood, without being able to discern how intensely the likelihood varies between two alternatives.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019> "medium uncertainty"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400017> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400020> (deep uncertainty)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400020> "Deep uncertainty is a level of model uncertainty at which one can enumerate multiple alternatives, without being able to rank them in order of likelihood.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400020> "deep uncertainty"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400017> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400020>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400021> (recognised ignorance)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400021> "Recognised ignorance is a level of model uncertainty at which one isn't able to enumerate multiple alternatives, while admitting the possibility of being surprised.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400021> "recognised ignorance"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400017> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400021>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410011> (ROG)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410011> "The ROG is a legislation providing the legal framework for spatial planning in Germany."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410011> "ROG"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410009> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410011>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410014> (BNatSchG)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410014> "The BNatSchG is a legislation providing the legal framework for nature conservation and landscape management in Germany."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410014> "BNatSchG"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410009> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410014>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410020> (WHG)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410020> "The WHG is a legislation providing the legal framework for water management in Germany."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410020> "WHG"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410009> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410020>)

# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410027> (BWaldG)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410027> "The BWaldG is a legislation providing the legal framework for the preservation of forests and the promotion of forestry in Germany."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410027> "BWaldG"@en)
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410009> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410027>)

