AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410052> "A medium voltage level is a voltage level in the german voltage classification system describing an electric potential difference between 10,000 and 30,000 volts."@en)
