AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410053> "A high voltage level is a voltage level in the german voltage classification system describing an electric potential difference of 110,000 volts."@en)
