AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410054> "A extra high voltage level is a voltage level in the german voltage classification system describing an electric potential difference between 220,000 and 380,000 volts."@en)
